 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "words lists the abusive words (lowercase). substitutions lists [symbol, letter] pairs; a symbol may stand for up to three letters. comment is tokens separated by single spaces. A token is abusive when it has the same length as some abusive word and, position by position, either the token letter equals the word letter or the token symbol has a substitution pair to the word letter; letters stand only for themselves and a symbol without a pair matches nothing. Return the 0-based indexes of abusive tokens in increasing order.",
